      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "收到！我先学习一下这家公司的BP和总裁助理JD，然后把公司简介补进去，输出 Word 版本。稍等几分钟 ☕",
      "source_message_ids": [
        "conv_0581d60474f4:dd7a0bc0"
      ],
      "user_created_at": null,
      "projection": "original AI occurrence"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_0581d60474f4:c72b3995",
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "已经吃透BP和JD了。公司是安徽中科微藻生物科技，做\"藻AI智碳\"（微藻固碳+数字孪生+碳资产），JD正好是上海子公司（宝山/吴淞）的总裁助理岗。我现在把公司简介补进去，输出Word。先看下docx生成规范：",
      "source_message_ids": [
        "conv_0581d60474f4:c72b3995"
      ],
      "user_created_at": null,
      "projection": "original AI occurrence"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_0581d60474f4:d5f47231",
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "BP和JD都学完了，思路清晰：把\"藻AI智碳\"的公司背景补成独立章节，再把岗位职责/任职要求做书面语完善。开始生成 Word。",
      "source_message_ids": [
        "conv_0581d60474f4:d5f47231"
      ],
      "user_created_at": null,
      "projection": "original AI occurrence"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_0581d60474f4:01f78693",
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "小问题：任职要求的编号跟着岗位职责连续排了（6、7…）。修一下让它各自从1开始。",
      "source_message_ids": [
        "conv_0581d60474f4:01f78693"
      ],
      "user_created_at": null,
      "projection": "original AI occurrence"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_0581d60474f4:0efe65bf",
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "编号已修复。看一下最终渲染效果：",
      "source_message_ids": [
        "conv_0581d60474f4:0efe65bf"
